00:16:00.919 --> 00:16:02.572 line:91%
I feel like we can—
I feel like we can do that.

00:16:02.572 --> 00:16:06.065 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, 'cause there's a maximum speed
that this gear can go.</c>

00:16:06.065 --> 00:16:07.467 line:85%
<c.cyan>So we'll bump up another two,</c>

