00:16:11.642 --> 00:16:12.823 line:85%
Alright...

00:16:14.138 --> 00:16:15.805 line:85%
What I can't explain is...

00:16:15.805 --> 00:16:18.877 line:91%
why my arms
are the most tired part of me.

00:16:18.877 --> 00:16:20.771 line:85%
Legs, doing absolutely fine.

00:16:20.771 --> 00:16:23.170 line:91%
But I think I'm just
holding myself like... solid.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.295 line:91%
<c.cyan>I think you're just a bit stiff.</c>
