00:16:38.883 --> 00:16:40.291 line:85%
Here we go.

00:16:43.031 --> 00:16:45.078 line:85%
<c.cyan>Oh my god, starts like a pro.</c>

00:16:45.889 --> 00:16:47.426 line:85%
Oh, that feels better!

00:16:47.426 --> 00:16:50.270 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yes, he's in the middle gear now.</c>

00:16:53.758 --> 00:16:55.718 line:91%
Finger on the brake,
