00:17:00.744 --> 00:17:03.032 line:91%
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh, I remember that!</c>
<c.cyan>Yes.</c>

00:17:04.942 --> 00:17:06.598 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yes, Tom.</c>

00:17:06.598 --> 00:17:08.211 line:85%
<c.cyan>Look at the speed.</c>

00:17:09.724 --> 00:17:11.549 line:85%
<c.cyan>He's absolutely nailed it.</c>

00:17:23.582 --> 00:17:25.525 size:84% position:58% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yes!</c>
