00:17:25.525 --> 00:17:29.261 line:85%
<c.cyan><i>(giggles) </i>That's how we do it!</c>

00:17:29.261 --> 00:17:31.909 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yes! Well done!</c>

00:17:32.753 --> 00:17:33.978 line:85%
<c.cyan>How'd you feel?</c>

00:17:35.356 --> 00:17:37.085 line:91%
<c.colorEEEEEE>I'm—</c>
