00:17:37.085 --> 00:17:39.049 line:85%
I'm... I'm out of breath.

00:17:39.049 --> 00:17:42.559 line:91%
I'm... very...
yeah, okay.

00:17:44.553 --> 00:17:47.118 line:91%
Oh, that felt good.
