That's fair... <00:18:24.180><c>but</c><i><b><00:18:24.331><c> ouch!</c></b></i>

00:18:26.275 --> 00:18:27.932 line:85%
<c.cyan>Well done, I'm gobsmacked.</c>

00:18:27.932 --> 00:18:29.627 position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>If only my videos were that quick(!)</c>

00:18:29.627 --> 00:18:31.376 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
